  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "MySQL: Fix when exec stmt with 0 params",
  "description": "When executing prepared statements with Query Attributes enabled and 0 parameters set Wireshark would still try to get the `hf_mysql_new_parameter_bound_flag` while already at the end of the packet.\n\nCapture:\n[mysql_ps_types.pcapng](/uploads/de3b0c2bd75c46c159a9bd64a032aa82/mysql_ps_types.pcapng)\n\nNote that there is another PR for the decoding of the `row packet` in this capture.\n\nWith this PR:\n![image](/uploads/b76e78638ab1f574c8adac6384c4c564/image.png)\n\nWithout this PR:\n![image](/uploads/91a07e6b04c1e22ca1d6777978b2e824/image.png)\n\nDocs: https://dev.mysql.com/doc/dev/mysql-server/latest/page_protocol_com_stmt_execute.html\nNote the `if (parameter_count > 0) {`.",
